<main class="main">

  <section class="tab-panel active" id="framework">

    <div class="doc-intro">Field Sales Playbook provides a comprehensive framework for commercial excellence across all Teya markets. It establishes the standards, processes, and tools that enable consistent, high-performance commercial execution from hiring and onboarding through to daily sales routines, performance tracking, and team culture.</div>

