          <p class="lead">The career path for field agents outlines a structured progression with clear entry gates, milestones, and lateral move opportunities. It is designed to be realistic and motivating: most agents reach a natural crossroads within three years &mdash; either advancing into a senior commercial role or moving laterally into management or specialist tracks.</p>

