<div class="skel-card" data-modal="progression-criteria"><h3>Progression criteria</h3><p>What is required to move to the next level, assessed across performance, sales skills, and behaviours</p></div>
<div class="skel-card" data-modal="performance-governance"><h3>Performance review governance</h3><p>How performance is evaluated and progression decisions are made consistently</p></div>
