        <p>As Field Agents progress, two areas evolve at each level: <b>conditions</b> &mdash; including (1) title, (2) base salary position, (3) base&ndash;commission ratio, and (4) additional perks and opportunities; and <b>expectations</b> &mdash; including (5) targets and (6) additional role requirements.</p>
        <p>The following structure serves as a <b>company-wide reference point</b>, providing a consistent view of how conditions and expectations evolve across levels. However, <b>markets have the flexibility to adapt key elements to local realities</b> &mdash; including role names, base salary bands, additional perks and opportunities, target expectations, and any additional role requirements.</p>

