  <!-- Modal: Development & training plan -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-development-training" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="development-training-title">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
      <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <div class="modal-header">
        <span class="modal-eyebrow">01 &middot; Sales career path</span>
        <h2 id="development-training-title">Development &amp; training plan</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>In order to support progression within the career framework, we need a structured development and training approach that equips agents with the capabilities required to perform, improve, and advance to the next level. This ensures that progression is not only defined, but actively enabled.</p>

        <div class="modal-sections">
          <div class="modal-section">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Part 01</span>
            <h3>Development plan by level</h3>
            <p>Development is structured by level and directly linked to performance, with each role having a clear focus on the capabilities required to succeed in the current role and prepare for the next one. It should be delivered through a combination of <b>training, on-the-job coaching, and performance feedback</b>, supported by consistent tools and frameworks across markets.</p>

            <div class="training-grid">
              <div class="training-col">
                <div class="training-arrow"><span class="lvl-tag">L1</span>BDA</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Objective</div>
                <div class="training-objective">Become field-ready</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Suggested trainings</div>
                <ul class="training-bullets">
                  <li>Onboarding journey (<a href="#" class="modal-link" data-target-sub="onboarding">see Section 3</a>)</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="training-col">
                <div class="training-arrow"><span class="lvl-tag">L2</span>BDR</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Objective</div>
                <div class="training-objective">Achieve consistent activity &amp; conversion</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Suggested trainings</div>
                <ul class="training-bullets">
                  <li>Master pipeline discipline</li>
                  <li>Pipeline prioritisation</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="training-col">
                <div class="training-arrow"><span class="lvl-tag">L3</span>S. BDR</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Objective</div>
                <div class="training-objective">Improve conversion &amp; deal quality</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Suggested trainings</div>
                <ul class="training-bullets">
                  <li>Advanced objection handling</li>
                  <li>Commercial judgment on value and pricing</li>
                  <li>Hiring &amp; evaluation training</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="training-col">
                <div class="training-arrow"><span class="lvl-tag">L4</span>BDM</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Objective</div>
                <div class="training-objective">Own pipeline strategy</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Suggested trainings</div>
                <ul class="training-bullets">
                  <li>Territory planning</li>
                  <li>Advanced negotiation</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="training-col">
                <div class="training-arrow"><span class="lvl-tag">L5</span>S. BDM</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Objective</div>
                <div class="training-objective">Deliver consistent high performance</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Suggested trainings</div>
                <ul class="training-bullets">
                  <li>Mentoring training</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="training-col">
                <div class="training-arrow"><span class="lvl-tag">L6</span>BDE</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Objective</div>
                <div class="training-objective">Scale impact through others</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Suggested trainings</div>
                <ul class="training-bullets">
                  <li>Coaching skills training</li>
                  <li>Performance diagnostics</li>
                  <li>Basic project planning</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="training-col">
                <div class="training-arrow"><span class="lvl-tag">L7</span>S. BDE</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Objective</div>
                <div class="training-objective">Drive standards &amp; performance</div>
                <div class="training-row-label">Suggested trainings</div>
                <ul class="training-bullets">
                  <li>Leadership development</li>
                  <li>Best practice development</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="modal-section">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Part 02</span>
            <h3>Lateral move support</h3>
            <p>The development framework also supports movement across roles by enabling targeted capability building aligned with the requirements of the new role.</p>

            <div class="lateral-table">
              <div class="lateral-row header">
                <div class="lateral-cell">Aspect</div>
                <div class="lateral-cell approach">Approach</div>
                <div class="lateral-cell coaching">Coaching &amp; evaluation</div>
              </div>
              <div class="lateral-row">
                <div class="lateral-cell aspect">Skill gap identification</div>
                <div class="lateral-cell approach">
                  <ul>
                    <li>Define required skills for the target role</li>
                    <li>Assess current gaps vs expectations</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="lateral-cell coaching">
                  <ul>
                    <li>Manager assessment using scorecards</li>
                    <li>Clear development focus areas</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="lateral-row">
                <div class="lateral-cell aspect">Targeted training</div>
                <div class="lateral-cell approach">
                  <ul>
                    <li>Role-specific training (e.g. advanced selling, account management)</li>
