  <!-- EVP Hungary sub-modal -->
  <div class="modal-overlay sub-modal" id="modal-evp-hungary" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="evp-hungary-title">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
      <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <div class="modal-header">
        <span class="modal-eyebrow">EVP example &middot; Hungary</span>
        <h2 id="evp-hungary-title">Teya Hungary &mdash; EVP</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="pillar-list">
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <h4>01 Company &amp; Mission</h4>
            <p>Hello! We're Teya. Teya is a payment and software service provider, headquartered in London serving small, local businesses across Europe. Founded in 2019, we build easy to use, integrated tools that enable our members to accept payments and boost business performance.</p>
            <p><b>At Teya we believe small, local businesses are the lifeblood of our communities.</b> We're here because we don't believe there's a level playing field that gives small businesses with a fighting chance against the giants of the high street. We're here to fight for a future where small, local businesses can thrive, and to commit the same dedication they offer all of us.</p>
            <p><b>Become a part of our story.</b> We're looking for exceptional talent to join our mission. We offer a chance to create impact in a high-energy and connected culture, while benefiting from continuous learning opportunities, a supportive community which is proud to serve our mission, and comprehensive benefits.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <h4>02 Compensation &amp; Benefits</h4>
            <p>Field Sales at Teya Hungary operates on a <b>base + variable model</b> designed to reward both activity and the quality of merchants you bring in. The harder and smarter you work, the more you earn &mdash; <b>there's no ceiling.</b></p>
            <p>Recognition at Teya isn't a once-a-year afterthought &mdash; it's built into how we work every day. Whether it's a quick <b>Teya Thanks</b> on Slack to call out a colleague in the moment, the monthly <b>Extra Mile Award</b> where the whole Hungary team votes for someone who's gone above and beyond, or the annual <b>Teya Culture Awards</b> celebrating those who best embody our values across the company &mdash; great work gets noticed.</p>
            <p>Within Field Sales, there's an extra layer of rituals too: from celebrating your very first deal and hitting your first 100, to Best Sales Agent awards, quarterly competitions, and public promotion announcements. The philosophy is simple &mdash; <b>recognition should be frequent, visible, and meaningful</b>, so the behaviors that make us great keep getting repeated.</p>
            <p><b>How We Support Your Wellbeing &mdash; </b>At Teya Hungary, we believe great work starts with people who feel genuinely supported &mdash; <b>physically, financially, mentally, and socially</b>. That's why our benefits go beyond the basics:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>All You Can Move SportPass XL &mdash; unlimited access to gyms, pools, and fitness facilities across Hungary</li>
              <li>Private health insurance (Union) &mdash; outpatient, inpatient, diagnostics, and 24/7 medical helpline</li>
              <li>3 health days per year &mdash; no doctor's note, no questions asked (including mental health)</li>
              <li>Glasses reimbursement &mdash; up to 50,000 HUF/year</li>
              <li>Cafeteria (SZ&Eacute;P Card) &mdash; up to 450,000 HUF/year gross, or as a cash top-up</li>
              <li>Transport covered &mdash; BKK pass reimbursed or a dedicated parking space</li>
              <li>Home-travel support</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <h4>03 Career &amp; Growth</h4>
            <p>At Teya, we actively support your growth and progression &mdash; whether that means <b>deepening your expertise in your current role and area or moving horizontally into new functions</b>. You'll have access to <b>internal training materials and resources, as well as clear career paths and internal mobility opportunities</b>. With Teya's strong global presence, you'll also collaborate closely with <b>international teams and join regular online global meetings</b>, so you're always up to date on our latest events and developments across markets.</p>
            <p>At Teya, career progression is structured and transparent. A company-wide <b>7-level framework provides a clear path from entry-level to leadership</b>, giving people a concrete view of where they're heading and what it takes to get there.</p>
            <p><b>Performance is reviewed monthly with your manager, with formal progression and promotion decisions aligned to company-wide review cycles</b> (typically every 6 months), supported by the possibility of off-cycle nominations based on demonstrated performance. <b>Lateral moves are built into the framework</b> too, so growing at Teya doesn't always mean moving up &mdash; it can mean moving across into new challenges like Key Accounts, Partnerships, or Territory Leadership.</p>
            <p><b>Learning and development run alongside progression at every stage.</b> The FutuReady programme develops high-potential field agents and junior leaders through interactive sessions and senior mentoring, while <b>structured onboarding, personal development plans, and a team-driven L&amp;D budget</b> ensure continuous growth.</p>
            <p>Beyond Hungary, Teya's presence across 15+ countries and a central-local operating model means <b>real international exposure</b> &mdash; whether through cross-border projects, multi-country programme cohorts, or supported international transfers with full relocation packages. It's an environment where ambition has room to move.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <h4>04 Culture &amp; People</h4>
            <p>You will be part of a <b>dynamic, close-knit community where your opinion is valued, and where you have the opportunity to explore, develop, and grow your ideas</b>. You'll join an <b>international team with a strong local presence</b> in the Hungarian market, so you can experience the benefits of a global company while staying close to local customers and colleagues. From your very first days, we place strong emphasis on helping you understand how our organisation and teams work, giving you a clear view of our processes and connecting you with colleagues across functions to enable effective collaboration in the future.</p>
            <p><b>Our leaders are approachable and hands-on, providing continuous support</b> so that you can feel confident in your role, work autonomously, and make the most of your strengths. They are open to questions, provide clear professional guidance, encourage initiative, and actively listen to your ideas &mdash; viewing individual suggestions and initiatives as a valuable source of innovation and contribution to the business.</p>
            <p>We are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone &mdash; regardless of race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, disability, religion, or background &mdash; can thrive and do their best work. <b>We believe that diverse teams lead to better ideas, stronger outcomes, and a more supportive workplace for all.</b></p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <h4>05 Work environment</h4>
            <p>Our Budapest hub is a <b>modern, welcoming office in the heart of Buda</b>, in an easily accessible location with excellent public transport connections. The working environment is <b>open and collaborative</b>, with bright spaces, shared lounge and kitchen areas, quiet meeting rooms for focused work, and community spaces that encourage connection and teamwork.</p>
            <p>We continuously invest in providing our colleagues with modern tools and systems, so they have everything they need to do their best work and succeed in their roles. We also foster a healthy work&ndash;life balance through a <b>hybrid working</b> model, giving colleagues the flexibility to combine time in the office with remote work.</p>
            <p>We are in the process of <b>opening our office in Gy&#x151;r</b>, alongside developing additional hubs outside of Budapest to further strengthen our presence in the Hungarian market. Teya is growing actively in Hungary and, together with our local teams and partners, we are focused on supporting as many Hungarian businesses as possible with our solutions. This means that, beyond our Budapest headquarters, there will be more and more opportunities to work in local teams with a strong on-the-ground presence across different regions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Agent profile & job description modal -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-agent-jd" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="agent-jd-title">
