  <!-- Talent pool & sourcing modal -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-talent-pool" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="talent-pool-title">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
      <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <div class="modal-header">
        <span class="modal-eyebrow">02 &middot; Recruitment process</span>
        <h2 id="talent-pool-title">Talent pool &amp; sourcing</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>Building a strong field sales team requires a structured approach to attracting the right candidates. This is a four-step process:</p>
        <div class="process-flow">
          <div class="process-step"><div class="pstep-num">1</div><h4>Define candidate segments</h4><p>Identify the profiles &mdash; competitor talent, related industry sales, high-potential non-sales, industry graduates &mdash; that fit the BDA/BDM profile.</p></div>
          <div class="process-step"><div class="pstep-num">2</div><h4>Choose sourcing channels</h4><p>Match channels to segments: proactive sourcing, job boards, referrals, alternative channels (community, partners, events).</p></div>
          <div class="process-step"><div class="pstep-num">3</div><h4>Build the funnel</h4><p>Estimate conversion rates per channel and back-solve the lead volume needed to deliver the hiring target.</p></div>
          <div class="process-step"><div class="pstep-num">4</div><h4>Execute &amp; iterate</h4><p>Run the sourcing plan, track funnel health weekly, and recalibrate channel mix and conversion assumptions.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="talent-section-title">Target candidate segments</div>
        <div class="talent-cards">
          <div class="talent-card">
            <div class="tc-head">Competitor profiles</div>
            <div class="tc-body">
              <div class="tc-headline">Win proven performers from competitors</div>
              <div class="tc-desc">Experienced field sales profiles from direct competitors with a proven track record in similar roles.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="talent-card">
            <div class="tc-head">Industry graduates</div>
            <div class="tc-body">
              <div class="tc-headline">Build early talent from within the industry</div>
              <div class="tc-desc">Graduate or early-career profiles with exposure to the industry and sales and strong potential to ramp quickly.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="talent-card">
            <div class="tc-head">Related industry sales</div>
            <div class="tc-body">
              <div class="tc-headline">Transfer proven sales skills from adjacent industries</div>
              <div class="tc-desc">Candidates with sales experience in adjacent industries (e.g. telco, FMCG, retail sales) bringing relevant, transferable skills.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="talent-card">
            <div class="tc-head">High-potential non-sales</div>
            <div class="tc-body">
              <div class="tc-headline">Unlock high-potential, motivated switchers</div>
              <div class="tc-desc">Candidates without direct sales experience but with strong value-add attributes (e.g. motivation, industry understanding).</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="talent-section-title">Talent pool channels</div>
        <div class="talent-cards">
          <div class="talent-card channel">
            <div class="tc-head">Inbound</div>
            <div class="tc-body">
              <div class="tc-headline">Job boards &amp; applications</div>
              <div class="tc-desc">Drive candidate volume through global platforms (e.g. Indeed, LinkedIn) and leading local job boards, ensuring a steady flow of applicants.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="talent-card channel">
            <div class="tc-head">Proactive sourcing</div>
            <div class="tc-body">
              <div class="tc-headline">Direct outreach</div>
              <div class="tc-desc">Target specific profiles through LinkedIn outreach and other database search to reach higher-quality or harder-to-find candidates.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="talent-card channel">
